WEBVTT

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:05.310
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:07.440
<i>takaku habatake</i>
Soar high up

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:10.190
<i>oozora o dokomade mo</i>
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.030
Shining Finger

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:13.900
<i>kagayaku hikari ga</i>
The shining light

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:17.280
<i>chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell</i>
A spell that spreads
miracles throughout the world

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:20.740
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:26.420
<i>furimukazu aruku no sa</i>
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:32.670
<i>mugen no chikara ga aru</i>
I have an unlimited power

00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:40.100
<i>nando demo tamesu no sa</i>
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:48.440
<i>donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru</i>
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:51.730
<i>ai wa itsumo kono mune ni</i>
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:55.240
<i>towa ni kieru koto wa nai</i>
It will never fade

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>kono te ga sakendeiru</i>
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.330
<i>ashita e to hashire</i>
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:04.080
Bright you now

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:08.580
<i>kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa</i>
The future that you envision

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:10.920
Shining Finger

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:12.590
<i>yume o tsukamou</i>
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:16.130
<i>subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance</i>
Everything will go
my way if I get a chance

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:24.810
This is the East Side.

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:27.060
The West Side is being
attacked by the Death Army.

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:28.140
Send reinforcements!

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:47.830
You're beginning to
annoy me now.

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:50.710
Time to teach you some manners!

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:55.420
Take this!

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:06.140
Now, Domon.

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:20.360
There's no end to these things!

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:26.540
Is my brother, I mean
Kyoji, behind all this?

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:28.910
Then I'll destroy every
one of you!

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:30.710
Every one of you!

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:37.210
Now, in Shinjuku of Neo Japan...

00:02:37.210 --> 00:02:41.010
...Domon was reunited
with his master...

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:44.800
...as fate takes a new turn
in the events of the times.

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:47.310
And in this city...

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:51.270
...a mysterious mobile suit force
called the Death Army...

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:55.400
...and the few surviving citizens
are fiercely battling it out.

00:02:56.480 --> 00:03:00.490
Today's surprise opponents
are these four Gundam Fighters.

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:04.320
Plus a fierce and
strange new Gundam.

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:06.280
And now!

00:03:06.280 --> 00:03:10.710
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:16.790
Big Trouble!
Domon vs. Big 5

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:48.330
Did you say you heard
someone playing the piano?

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:52.290
It was picked up by chance
on a cable broadcast channel.

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:02.340
Does this mean there are
other survivors?

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:03.470
It's possible.

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:06.220
I'm sure there are people
crying out for help.

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:09.220
Send an SOS through a piano, huh?

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:11.810
Do you know where
it's coming from?

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:16.350
We've confirmed that it's coming
from an old transmission tower.

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:20.980
The perfect location for an
underground broadcast station.

00:04:20.980 --> 00:04:23.070
We know that there are survivors.

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:25.320
Are we going to rescue them?

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:29.280
Now that we know there are
survivors in need of help...

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:31.240
...we cannot ignore it.

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:33.410
We can't abandon them.

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:34.540
Wait a minute!

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:37.330
I understand the importance
of a rescue...

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:39.630
...but we can't weaken
our guard here.

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:41.710
Well, yes...

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:43.010
Don't worry.

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:45.470
We'll only need a few men.

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:46.380
What do you mean?

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:48.800
Let's see...

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:50.390
Two men, including myself.

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:51.850
You're going yourself?!

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:53.100
Only two men?!

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:54.890
That's crazy!

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:57.690
That area's totally controlled
by the enemy.

00:04:57.690 --> 00:04:59.400
It's like committing suicide!

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:00.860
Wrong.

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:04.240
A larger force would draw
the attention of the enemy.

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:05.900
Do you agree with me, Domon?

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:07.030
Master...

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:10.330
Domon, will you join me in this mission?

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:11.780
My pleasure.

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:21.340
Listen, Domon.

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:24.530
There are only two of us but the
enemy won't let us off so easily.

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:26.510
So stay alert.

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:27.800
Right, Master!

00:05:31.550 --> 00:05:32.970
Master's amazing.

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:33.970
He moves without effort.

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:40.150
Here comes the enemy, Domon.

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:42.320
They don't know how powerful we are.

00:05:46.440 --> 00:05:47.700
Let's show them!

00:06:14.760 --> 00:06:16.220
Good work, Domon.

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:19.270
I see you've improved considerably.

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:21.520
Thanks to your teachings.

00:06:22.810 --> 00:06:25.480
This reminds me of the days
when I was training you.

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:27.860
I can barely contain my excitement.

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:29.030
Let's go, Domon!

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:29.700
Yes, sir!

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:39.460
The tower they're headed to
is outside our perimeter...

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:41.670
...but there is one route
that's not well guarded.

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:45.090
From Yotsuya,
past the Diet building...

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:48.150
...and through Kasumigaseki
to the tower.

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:50.680
With this route, they should be
able to avoid fighting.

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:52.970
However...

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:55.680
...because of enemy
radio interference...

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:57.600
...we won't be able to contact them.

00:06:57.970 --> 00:07:01.520
Those two men seem to be
enjoying the danger.

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:04.610
They're not at all like the others.

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:06.400
They're both Gundam Fighters.

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:09.190
They go by different standards.

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:15.580
There're four huge energy sources
around the tower!

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:17.080
Domon and Master are in danger!

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:19.750
Domon, can you feel it?

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:22.670
The evil energy that's
waiting for us?

00:07:22.980 --> 00:07:24.340
Evil energy?

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:28.670
Well, I was getting bored anyway.

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:31.090
How about it, Domon?

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:34.720
Why don't we make it a race
to see which one of us...

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:36.300
...can get to the tower first?

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:38.770
You want to race?

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:41.730
I want to see how good you are.

00:07:42.470 --> 00:07:43.100
Master...!

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:45.060
I'm going ahead!

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:47.450
He's gone alone
without his Gundam.

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:49.820
Then I'll do it, too.

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:50.570
Domon!

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:52.900
Hang on!

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:56.240
I detected mobile suits that look
like Gundams...

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:58.160
...around the tower.

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:59.040
Four of them!

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:01.400
It's too dangerous to
go on your own.

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:03.750
Besides, where did Master go?

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:07.250
Mobile suits that have the
power of Gundams...

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:08.920
It's impossible.

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:10.050
Domon...

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:11.880
I'm going, too!
Take me with you!

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:15.510
Rain.
Does this subway go to the tower?

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:17.260
The subway?

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:17.970
Hang on.

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:23.980
Yes. Along the same route
we're taking.

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:25.810
But there're no subways running.

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:27.060
Okay.

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:28.190
I'm going to go that way.

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:30.900
From here? Are you crazy?!

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:33.360
Gundam's right hand is
kind of slow.

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:35.110
Sure you adjusted it properly?

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:36.440
What? Are you sure?

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:37.950
Domon!

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:40.280
Just wait there with the Gundam!

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:44.910
I also happen to be a crewmember
of the Shining Gundam!

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:53.420
There's no point in winning
if I use my Gundam.

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:57.340
And Rain will be safe
if she stays with the Gundam.

00:08:57.340 --> 00:09:00.100
Wouldn't want the Devil Gundam
to show up, after all.

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:05.890
I see.
No wonder the trains aren't running.

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:09.810
Looks like Master went this way.
Me too, then.

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:16.900
Rain's information isn't
reliable as ever.

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:25.290
It's as if the train came
just for me.

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:33.500
Who else would be on this train?

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:38.260
What's up, Neo Japan?

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:41.300
Chibodee Crocket?!

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:42.720
What are you doing here?

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:45.730
I've come to fight you.

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:47.140
What?!

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:48.730
What's this all about?!

00:09:54.150 --> 00:09:55.860
Stop it, Chibodee!

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:57.570
This isn't the time for it!

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:03.950
He's gotten a lot stronger
than he used to be!

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:07.250
What's wrong, Neo Japan?

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:13.290
Chibodee!

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:15.880
Damn!

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:23.600
That was close.

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:24.710
But...

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:32.560
There's nothing wrong with it.
What a liar.

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:33.190
What?!

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:37.740
Oh, no! The enemy mobile suits
are coming here!

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:46.070
They're onto me!

00:10:46.730 --> 00:10:48.450
Oh, no!

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:49.870
Domon!

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:58.090
Chibodee's new power and speed.

00:10:58.460 --> 00:11:00.340
How could that be?

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:02.180
What?!

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:04.340
A train from the opposite direction!

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:06.760
And one from behind!

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:20.240
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:23.950
One in front and
one behind me!

00:11:25.990 --> 00:11:26.870
Which one's faster?

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:28.910
The front one!

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:39.950
Those weren't runaway trains.

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:42.560
Someone's after me.

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:49.560
That was some escape.
Very impressive, Bro.

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:50.850
But, you know...

00:11:51.430 --> 00:11:53.310
...the game is only starting now.

00:11:54.190 --> 00:11:56.580
I'm sure you're
gonna enjoy this, Bro.

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:00.990
Is that a battle?!

00:12:01.550 --> 00:12:03.110
Could it be Rain?

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:04.110
No.

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:06.410
She would've gotten away
before the battle.

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:16.750
The Gundam can't fight them all
on automatic pilot.

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:18.410
In that case...

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:22.260
...if I activate the
mobile trace system...

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:23.360
...I can do it!

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:38.730
It's tight!

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:50.410
Come and get me, guys!

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:04.220
Don't underestimate the power
of a woman!

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:12.030
Where am I now?

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:20.760
I'm being targeted!

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:24.400
This attack...

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:26.860
It's as if someone's been
waiting for me.

00:13:27.240 --> 00:13:29.490
Is the Death Army behind this?

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:41.230
Neo Russia's Argo Gulskii?

00:13:41.790 --> 00:13:42.800
Just what are you doing here?

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:44.540
Domon Kasshu.

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:46.420
I'm here to defeat you.

00:13:46.420 --> 00:13:49.260
I don't have the time to fight you!

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:57.980
So, he was controlling the trains!

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:00.690
Argo.

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:03.150
Climb aboard.

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:06.320
Darn it. He got away.

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:09.360
But that's okay because we know
where he's headed now.

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:11.280
See ya soon, Bro.

00:14:12.020 --> 00:14:13.280
Chibodee and Argo...

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:15.290
Why were they both after me?

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:16.200
Why?!

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:18.920
Is that light from the outside?

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:21.790
Stroke of luck.

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:24.010
It's too dangerous to go
any further underground.

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:29.550
I've come out under the tower!

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:31.820
I'm getting worried about Master.

00:14:31.820 --> 00:14:32.550
Better hurry.

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:37.140
You'll never hit me!

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:55.870
Good work, Gundam!

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:03.720
I'd better hurry to Domon.

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:05.040
What?!

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:16.580
I wonder if there's anyone else
in this place.

00:15:20.430 --> 00:15:21.390
A piano?

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:27.320
I'm sure it's coming
from in here.

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:30.650
Well, Master.
It looks like I'm the winner.

00:15:32.130 --> 00:15:34.490
I've come to rescue you,
Mr. Piano Player.

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:40.160
Say something.
I've come to save you.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:44.680
Nice to you see again,
Domon Kasshu.

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:48.460
George?

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:50.210
So you were playing the piano?

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:51.920
What's going on here?!

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:54.640
You want an answer to that?

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:56.060
An answer?!

00:16:01.680 --> 00:16:03.690
Long time no see, Bro.

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:06.510
Sai Saici! You as well?!

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:10.110
Are you saying this was a trap
set up by the four of you?!

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:12.650
You're finally catching on!

00:16:13.900 --> 00:16:14.600
Here I go!

00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:15.430
I challenge you!

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:18.370
Where did you get such powers?

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:28.210
How has he become
so much stronger?!

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:32.380
I'm not done with you!

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:43.140
Surprised, Neo Japan?

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:44.770
Aren't we stronger?

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:47.940
It feels like the body is
overflowing with power.

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:51.070
Yeah, it's an unbelievably
great feeling of power!

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:52.860
I bet you'd like some, too.

00:16:53.190 --> 00:16:55.570
This power we've received
from a certain person.

00:16:55.950 --> 00:16:57.530
A certain person?!

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:00.490
It's Kyoji!

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:06.960
If you've become Kyoji's slaves...

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:09.500
...then I can't afford to lose.

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:12.210
In the name of the King of Hearts!

00:17:14.990 --> 00:17:15.680
What the...?!

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:16.810
What's happening?!

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:24.640
My Gundam!

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:25.600
But what's it doing here?!

00:17:30.210 --> 00:17:30.860
Rain!

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:37.160
How reckless of you
to wear the Fight Suit.

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:39.210
But, I was surrounded by enemies...

00:17:44.950 --> 00:17:47.460
They've all come
with their Gundams.

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:49.540
We've got no choice now
but to force our way through!

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:54.840
Domon!

00:17:55.320 --> 00:17:56.510
O-over there!

00:18:01.630 --> 00:18:02.260
What was that?!

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:26.160
Is that also a Gundam?

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:26.870
Is that...?

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:39.720
That's the Gundam!

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:41.180
The one that attacked me earlier!

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:42.010
What?!

00:18:45.010 --> 00:18:46.180
I-it couldn't be!

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:49.360
Darkness Finger!

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:55.630
Incredible!

00:18:56.150 --> 00:18:59.360
Who could be piloting it,
with such awesome power?

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:01.030
Is this power of the
Devil Gundam?!

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:05.490
Is he also a follower of Kyoji?

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:12.750
Then I'll just have to destroy you!

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:35.820
The Shining Finger
is losing power!

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:38.690
His power is much greater
than mine!

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:40.110
I just might lose!

00:19:41.650 --> 00:19:42.200
Rain!

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:44.120
Listen!

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:46.580
You escape right now
with the Core Lander!

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:48.830
At least one of us can escape this!

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:49.450
But Domon!

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:50.000
Hurry!

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:51.850
Why just me?

00:19:51.850 --> 00:19:52.960
We'll go together!

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:55.710
This battle is between Kyoji
and myself.

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:57.920
I don't want you to get caught up...

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:01.220
Rain...

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:04.640
I'm your partner.

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:07.180
We're going to fight together.

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:08.550
Rain...

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:12.780
This hand glows with
an awesome power!

00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:15.860
Its burning grip tells me
to defeat you!

00:20:15.860 --> 00:20:17.400
The Ultimate!

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:22.280
Shining Finger!

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:27.530
Take this!

00:21:10.520 --> 00:21:11.370
Domon.

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:12.830
Master!

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:25.130
If everything you've said is true...

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:27.140
...that would mean this was
all a trap.

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:32.020
And a strange giant Gundam with
horns that I've never seen before?

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:32.900
Yes.

00:21:33.300 --> 00:21:35.530
We were very lucky to escape.

00:21:36.850 --> 00:21:41.730
In any case, it seems the enemy's
power is unimaginably ferocious.

00:21:42.530 --> 00:21:43.990
Don't let your guard down!

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:45.510
Yes, Master!

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:49.910
Now...

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:54.000
...it seems that one more storm
cloud is darkening this story.

00:21:55.410 --> 00:21:58.350
What is the identity of
that strange horned Gundam?

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:04.260
Have Chibodee and the others become
followers of the Devil Gundam?

00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:09.260
And is this the doing
of Domon's brother, Kyoji?

00:22:10.090 --> 00:22:12.220
Or, is someone else involved?

00:22:28.150 --> 00:22:32.780
<i>Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo</i>
No matter how much time passes

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:37.160
<i>tadori tsukenu basho o</i>
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:37.460 --> 00:22:41.630
<i>samayoi motomenagara</i>
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:42.090 --> 00:22:45.170
<i>aruite yuku</i>
I keep going forward

00:22:45.460 --> 00:22:52.350
<i>koibito yo,</i>
watashi no hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:52.850 --> 00:22:58.060
<i>kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga</i>
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:58.270 --> 00:23:03.310
<i>dore hodo tsutawaru no desho</i>
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:09.860
<i>Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete</i>
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:10.240 --> 00:23:13.990
<i>atataka na kono mune de</i>
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:20.000
<i>umi yori mo fukaku nemutte</i>
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:31.300 --> 00:23:33.220
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:33.220 --> 00:23:34.760
More surprises!

00:23:34.760 --> 00:23:38.050
What Rain saw was a factory
creating those mysterious soldiers.

00:23:38.520 --> 00:23:42.400
As the mystery deepens, the
Death Army continues to attack.

00:23:42.400 --> 00:23:45.440
And while Domon is
struggling against his rivals...

00:23:45.440 --> 00:23:48.570
...Master's true identity
is revealed.

00:23:49.440 --> 00:23:51.450
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:51.450 --> 00:23:55.140
Shocking!
Shining Finger Defeated!

00:23:54.410 --> 00:24:00.490
Shocking!
Shining Finger Defeated!

00:23:55.120 --> 00:23:57.870
Ready! Go!
